      "instance_name": "anthropomorphism",
      "label": "Anthropomorphism of animals",
      "description": "The meme assigns human-like thoughts, emotions, and motives (e.g., guilt, innocence, blame) to animals (dog and cat), which is a common artistic and comedic device. Understanding this concept is necessary to interpret the humor and narrative of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
