      "label": "Cat as innocent victim stereotype",
      "description": "The meme plays on the common internet stereotype of cats as 'victims' who are often portrayed as innocent, dramatic, or unfairly blamed in humorous scenarios. The cat's disheveled appearance and 'I was pushed!!' text reinforce this trope, which requires knowledge of internet cat culture and animal humor stereotypes.",
