      "label": "Dog as guilty/blame-shifting party stereotype",
      "description": "The meme uses the stereotype of dogs as mischievous or culpable parties in accidents, often portrayed with smug or guilty expressions. The dog's satisfied look and the text 'the cat slipped and fell into the toilet' imply guilt, which relies on understanding common animal behavior stereotypes in internet memes.",
