      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "dog is the guilty party who caused the accident",
      "description": "The text 'the cat slipped and fell into the toilet' is mapped onto the visual of the dog, implying the dog is the one who caused the accident (or at least is responsible for the cat's fall) by its smug expression. The dog's visual portrayal (smug, satisfied look) is used to represent the textual claim of culpability.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
